Zerox a file, then edit through the front window so the partially-covered (Some)
back window gets refreshed and allocates a backing store. Then sweep a new window
that fully covers the back window: it goes Some->None while holding a backing, so
newvisibilities frees that backing (the V(Some,None) freeimage branch).

